  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to We Effect to identify and support national Civil Society   Organisations to implement Sida program in social accountability in   natural resource management. The support will as much as possible be  given as core support, provided national partners fulfill some basic  criteria. This is a sub-programme of the whole AGIR programme in      which other sub-programmes are managed by Diakonia, Ibis and Oxfam.</narrative>
